# The live session, as greetd starts it for the live user: Crimson Banner OS on X11. Its output goes to the journal
# (greetd runs it under systemd-cat), and a crash's stack trace comes from systemd-coredump (elfutils), so a broken
# ISO says why.
exec startx /usr/bin/env /usr/bin/redstaros-session
